# Keep the build context small and free of secrets. turbo prune selects what each
# image needs; everything here is either regenerated in the build or never shipped.
# 保持构建上下文小且不含密钥。turbo prune 会为每个镜像挑选所需文件；以下内容要么在构建中重新生成，要么永不进入镜像。

# Installed or built inside the image. 在镜像内安装或构建。
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Local-only tooling and history. 仅本地使用的工具目录与 git 历史。
.git
.claude
.vscode
.devcontainer

# Test and eval output. 测试与评测输出。
tests/e2e/test-results
tests/e2e/playwright-report
evals/results
**/*.log

# Secrets never enter an image; runtime config comes from the environment. 密钥永不进入镜像；运行时配置来自环境变量。
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
